# Interface: TodoApi
## Version: 1.0.0
## Authentication: none
## BaseRoute: /api

### Endpoints
- GET /todos: list all todo items => 200: TodoDtoList
- POST /todos: create a new todo item => 201: TodoDto
- GET /todos/{id}: fetch one todo item => 200: TodoDto
- PUT /todos/{id}: update an existing todo item => 200: TodoDto
- DELETE /todos/{id}: delete a todo item => 204: Empty

### Schemas
- TodoDto: Id: Guid required; Title: string required; IsCompleted: bool
- CreateTodoRequest: Title: string required max=200

### ErrorContracts
- 400: invalid request payload code=TODO_VALIDATION_ERROR
- 404: no todo item with the given id code=TODO_NOT_FOUND
